<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="title">Markdown 渲染对比</view>
    <view class="meta">语料：{{sampleName}} · {{sampleBytes}} 字节</view>
    <view class="actions">
      <button size="mini" type="primary" onTap="runAll" disabled="{{running}}">
        {{running ? '运行中…' : '重新跑'}}
      </button>
      <button size="mini" onTap="cycle" disabled="{{running}}">
        切换语料
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="stats">
    <view class="row header-row">
      <view class="col col-name">库</view>
      <view class="col col-time">渲染耗时 (ms)</view>
      <view class="col col-trend">相对最快</view>
    </view>
    <block a:for="{{rows}}" a:key="key">
      <view class="row">
        <view class="col col-name">{{item.label}}</view>
        <view class="col col-time">{{item.time === null ? '—' : item.time.toFixed(1)}}</view>
        <view class="col col-trend">{{item.trend || '—'}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="panels">
    <view class="panel">
      <view class="panel-title">x-markdown-mini</view>
      <x-markdown content="{{xContent}}" onRenderComplete="onXReady" />
    </view>

    <view class="panel">
      <view class="panel-title">towxml</view>
      <towxml nodes="{{towxmlNodes}}" />
    </view>

    <view class="panel">
      <view class="panel-title">marked + rich-text</view>
      <rich-text nodes="{{rtHtml}}" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footnote">
    各库测的是「点击 → 渲染就绪事件 / setData callback」的 JS 侧总耗时（含库内 parse + setData 推送）。
    rich-text 原生 layout/paint 的部分不在 JS 可观测范围内。
    数字会有几毫秒抖动，建议多跑几次取中位数。
  </view>
</view>
